{
 "description": "The rare materials of MH XX's monsters that MH4U lacks, new items of MH4U that the Layered Gear looks of those monsters cost (core/equipment/layered/xx_materials.py). 'first_id': the id of slot 0; an item's id is first_id + slot, far past the ported monsters' items, and slots are only appended. 'monsters': each monster by MH Generations Ultimate's English name: 'em' the numbers of his XX reward lists (two for a monster of two forms), 'variant' 4 for a deviant, 'base' a deviant's species, 'categories' XX item categories whose items are his parts besides the ones named after him, 'not_asked' items of his never asked (inorganic, or a small monster's too), 'ported' the key of his port (Mizutsune, Soulseer Mizutsune, Glavenus, Hellblade Glavenus, Alatreon, Great Maccao: his items join a run only when that ported monster is not in it, Materials.without_ported), 'ranks' the ranks he has picks at (Alatreon: high and G), 'sets' the armor sets (group names) that are a deviant's (Hellblade, Soulseer: their looks ask his items, a weapon the base's). 'items': written by tools/build/build_xx_materials.py from XX's lists: 'slot', 'mhgen' (XX's item id), English 'name', the 'monster' and 'rank' whose looks ask it ('also': others that ask it too), 'found' (the XX list and best percent it comes from); 'obtain' says how a player gets it in MH4U (empty until decided).",
